#nexus

[!
SARS-CoV-2 haplotypes from the Diamond Princess cruise-ship outbreak and
contemporaneous sequences, as distributed with:

Bo Xu, Lun Li, Cuiping Li, Anke Wang, Zhuojing Fan, Shuhui Song, HaploThread:
a scalable desktop tool for efficient haplotype network inference and
interactive visualization, Molecular Biology and Evolution, Volume 43, Issue 3,
March 2026, msag052, https://doi.org/10.1093/molbev/msag052

Sequences from Diamond_Princess.phy (482 taxa, 444 variable sites).
Traits from Diamond_Princess.tsv; world coordinates added -- see README.md.
The date is carried by the three numerical month-bin traits; run make-traits.py
--with-date for a categorical 'Date' trait with the exact value per sample.
]

